1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,806
Rose: Hey, how's the fern?

2
00:00:01,926 --> 00:00:04,252
Casey: Never better. We just had our anniversary.

3
00:00:04,372 --> 00:00:05,072
record scratch.wav

4
00:00:05,072 --> 00:00:06,001
Rose: We.

5
00:00:06,121 --> 00:00:08,172
Casey: We, yes. Two years, Rose. She and I.

6
00:00:08,292 --> 00:00:09,989
Rose: You named a plant and you're keeping a count.

7
00:00:10,109 --> 00:00:11,513
Casey: Her name is Fernanda.

8
00:00:11,633 --> 00:00:12,233
thud.wav

9
00:00:12,233 --> 00:00:13,445
Rose: Does she talk back?

10
00:00:13,565 --> 00:00:16,277
Casey: She dozes. I talk, she dozes. That's a relationship, Rose.

11
00:00:16,397 --> 00:00:17,609
Rose: I talk to my smoke detector.

12
00:00:17,729 --> 00:00:20,983
Casey: I got her a doctor. Plant hospital. She had a root thing.

13
00:00:21,103 --> 00:00:22,928
Rose: You took a houseplant to a hospital.

14
00:00:23,048 --> 00:00:25,197
Casey: It was serious, Rose. It was a whole root thing.

15
00:00:25,317 --> 00:00:28,859
Rose: Let me guess. Water twice a week, some light, don't overthink it.

16
00:00:28,979 --> 00:00:30,609
Casey: You Googled it.

17
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:31,426
Rose: Last night.

18
00:00:31,546 --> 00:00:32,753
Casey: You mocked my fern.

19
00:00:32,873 --> 00:00:35,062
Rose: I respect the fern. I just don't need a biography.

20
00:00:35,182 --> 00:00:37,905
Casey: Okay, can I at least have the anniversary dinner?

21
00:00:38,025 --> 00:00:40,230
Casey: Actually hold on, I need to check her soil.

22
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,150
thud.wav

23
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,751
Casey: Rose. Rose, there's no dirt.

24
00:00:42,871 --> 00:00:44,134
Rose: Mm-hmm.

25
00:00:44,254 --> 00:00:46,861
Casey: There's a tag. Rose, there's a barcode on the pot.

26
00:00:46,981 --> 00:00:48,446
Rose: Forty-nine cents.

27
00:00:48,566 --> 00:00:50,044
Casey: Forty-nine cents for what?

28
00:00:50,164 --> 00:00:51,698
Rose: Dollar aisle. That's where she lived.

29
00:00:51,818 --> 00:00:54,998
Casey: You let me plan a two-year anniversary for a dollar-aisle fern.

30
00:00:55,118 --> 00:00:57,676
Rose: She died in a dollar aisle, Casey. Before she ever met you.

31
00:00:57,796 --> 00:00:58,796
sad trombone.wav

32
00:00:59,596 --> 00:01:02,280
Rose: Her name's Linda. Eleven dollars. She's alive.

33
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:04,312
Casey: Can I still have the dinner?

34
00:01:04,432 --> 00:01:04,712
Casey: Thank you, Rose.

35
00:01:04,832 --> 00:01:07,568
Rose: And if you tell anyone about this, I will deny everything.
